<title>UK: Suedboden sets 100 mln mark May 2002 step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Suedboden sets 100 mln mark May 2002 step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDDEUTSCHE BODENCREDITBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN MARK  COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    13.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.875   PAY DATE    23.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125 PCT REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*IN YEAR ONE RISING TO 4.5 PERCENT IN YEAR TWO,</p>
<p>		 4.75 PERCENT IN YEAR THREE, 5.0 PERCENT IN YEAR</p>
<p>		 FOUR, 6.0 PERCENT IN YEAR FIVE AND 7.0 PERCENT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE 425</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
